<opt:body xmlns:opt="https://www.openpower.tools/ns/opt">
      <p>Label/value pairs for hardware specs, firmware versions and other metadata. The
      definition list is regular light-DOM markup; the element lays it out on a grid.</p>
      <h2>Example</h2>
      <opt:key-value>
        <dl>
          <dt>Mainboard</dt><dd>Talos II Lite (T2P9S01)</dd>
          <dt>CPU</dt><dd>POWER9 Sforza, 8 cores, DD2.3</dd>
          <dt>BMC</dt><dd>ASpeed AST2500 running OpenBMC</dd>
          <dt>Host firmware</dt><dd>Hostboot, Skiboot, Petitboot</dd>
          <dt>PNOR</dt><dd>128 Mbit SPI flash</dd>
        </dl>
      </opt:key-value>
      <h2>Markup</h2>
      <pre>&lt;opt:key-value&gt;
  &lt;dl&gt;
    &lt;dt&gt;CPU&lt;/dt&gt;&lt;dd&gt;POWER9 Sforza, 8 cores&lt;/dd&gt;
  &lt;/dl&gt;
&lt;/opt:key-value&gt;</pre>

</opt:body>
